      "value": "just gonna comment, if there is a way to implement a reinit like PhysBoneTK, within Physbone Script, and embed this as a parameter in the PhysBoneScript, it would indeed be very nice and relatively performant.\nEXemple:\nStretch could be a 1D parameter between 0 and 5\nGravity could also be a 2D Cartesian plot where X = Gravity and Y = Falloff.\nthat's what i was hoping to achieve personnally, amongst having a full menu for the physbones :3",
