  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Dynamic bones allowed us to animate its properties in game such as changing gravity on demand with a simple blend tree. According to the documentation on Phys bones, \"PhysBone properties like Spring, Pull, Stiffness, etc are set at initialization and cannot be animated.\"\nAfter discussing with some nice members of the community in the discord i learned there there was PhysBonesTK https://github.com/naqtn/PhysBonesTK (from what i can tell, this is the same exact way that a avatar in the Avatar Dynamics hub does it, so this does work in game)\nIt seems weird to me that you'd need a whole complicated work around for something that was as easy as a single animation in Dyn Bones. I really hope that some time in the future Phys Bones may be updated to support animations much the way Dyn bones did.",
